          "name": "Son",
          "expression": "surprised",
          "pose": "sit"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": null,
      "narration": "That's exactly what the French thought. Europe had a battle just like Okehazama. Knights in shining armor, a young king with something to prove, and a field full of mud. Want to hear it?",
