          "expression": "smug",
          "pose": "walk"
        },
        {
          "name": "Narrator",
          "expression": "surprised",
          "pose": "stand"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": "Prince Hal?",
      "narration": "Legend says that as a young prince, he was a wild party boy who spent his nights in taverns. Shakespeare made that story famous. Historians aren't sure how much of it is true. Either way, by the time he became king, the party was over.",
      "word_count": 45
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-06",
      "speaker": null,
      "section": "A king with a claim",
      "start": 110,
      "duration": 21,
      "image": "images/shot-06.png",
      "background": "parchment",
      "camera": "static",
      "characters": [
        {
          "name": "English knight",
          "expression": "angry",
          "pose": "stand"
        },
        {
          "name": "French knight",
          "expression": "angry",
          "pose": "stand"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": "The Hundred Years' War (1337–1453)",
      "narration": "Henry believed he had a right to the throne of France. His great-grandfather Edward the Third had claimed it too, and England and France had been fighting on and off for generations. We call it the Hundred Years' War, even though it actually lasted more than a hundred years.",
      "word_count": 49
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-07",
      "speaker": null,
      "section": "A king with a claim",
      "start": 131,
      "duration": 16,
      "image": "images/shot-07.png",
      "background": "hall",
      "camera": "quick push in",
      "characters": [
        {
          "name": "Charles VI",
          "expression": "surprised",
          "pose": "stand"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": "Charles VI of France",
      "narration": "And France was in trouble. Its king, Charles the Sixth, suffered from long bouts of mental illness. During some of them, it's said, he believed he was made of glass, and was terrified that he might shatter.",
      "word_count": 37
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-08",
      "speaker": null,
      "section": "A king with a claim",
      "start": 147,
      "duration": 11,
      "image": "images/shot-08.png",
      "background": "hall",
      "camera": "static",
      "characters": [
        {
          "name": "French noble",
          "expression": "angry",
          "pose": "stand"
        },
        {
          "name": "French noble",
          "expression": "angry",
          "pose": "stand"
        },
        {
          "name": "Charles VI",
          "expression": "closed",
          "pose": "stand"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": null,
      "narration": "Meanwhile, two powerful groups of French nobles were feuding over who should really run the country. For Henry, it looked like the perfect moment.",
      "word_count": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-09",
      "speaker": null,
      "section": "Harfleur",
      "start": 158,
      "duration": 11,
      "image": "images/shot-09.png",
      "background": "siege",
      "camera": "slow pan left",
      "characters": [
        {
          "name": "Henry V",
          "expression": "determined",
